    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10042" root="خثى" body-key="x">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَثَى</span></b> , aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَخْثِى</span>, inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَثْىٌ</span>, said of a
beast of the ox-kind, (JK, S, Msb, K,) or of a
bull, but not [<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَثَتْ</span>] of a cow, (A 'Obeyd, TA,)
and of an elephant, (K,) <i>He dunged.</i> (JK, S,
Msb, K.) [See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خِثْىٌ</span>.]

